        "answer": {
          "short": "$324$",
          "worked": "The common primes are $2$ and $3$. Take the smallest index of each; $5$ is not common to both numbers.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{HCF}&=2^2\\times3^4\\\\\\mathrm{HCF}&=4\\times81\\\\\\mathrm{HCF}&=324\\end{align*}$$",
