        "answer": {
          "short": "$120$",
          "worked": "The common primes are $2$, $3$ and $5$. Take the smallest index of each.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{HCF}&=2^3\\times3\\times5\\\\\\mathrm{HCF}&=8\\times3\\times5\\\\\\mathrm{HCF}&=120\\end{align*}$$",
